# Cloudflare Pages custom headers -- https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Advertises the MCP server on every response, per the discoverability
# pattern documented at https://specification.website/mcp/.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security and the clickjacking/CSP/Permissions-Policy
# headers below are items from specification.website/spec/security/ that
# Cloudflare Pages does not set by default (unlike X-Content-Type-Options
# and Referrer-Policy, which it already adds automatically).
#
# script-src allowlists this exact site's three static inline <script>
# blocks by content hash (index.html, alerts.html, companies.html) instead
# of 'unsafe-inline' -- an injected <script> tag from anywhere else won't
# match any of these hashes, so it won't execute. If one of those inline
# scripts' content ever changes, its hash must be recomputed here too, or
# the page breaks (CSP silently blocks the mismatched script). functions/
# jobs/[slug].js is the one page rendered per-request rather than served
# static, so it sets its own Content-Security-Policy with a real nonce
# instead of relying on this file -- see that Function's own CSP_HEADER.
/*
  Link: <https://12getajob.com/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json>; rel="mcp"
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com 'sha256-5/QLZuAFiZODkYaHOnWLWBlxRj+8bnHBDS70DBwjyVM=' 'sha256-0lGKnTxvlUzRUuYxH88R7CEcKvXzVozsKNdVeEr6EqQ=' 'sha256-iUdOHn6+GnDSYKKFPIfnAv7MQAyAdVA+wXzC9RKsRW4='; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com 'unsafe-inline'; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://hub.12getajob.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
